				Ath.
				1.33c
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. βοτάνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orib.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					52
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιεῖν</span>) <i>inert,</i>
